<title>ISRAEL: Israel April trade deficit narrows to $672 mln.</title>
<headline>Israel April trade deficit narrows to $672 mln.</headline>
<dateline>JERUSALEM</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel's trade deficit in April totalled $672 million, the Central Bureau of Statistics said.</p>
<p>	     April 97   March 97    April 96</p>
<p>Exports    1,529	1,838	 1,349</p>
<p>Imports    2,200	2,738	 2,231</p>
<p>Balance     -672	 -900	  -882</p>
<p>Note - Figures are in millions of dollars.</p>
<p>		    Jan-Apr 97   Jan-Apr 96</p>
<p>Exports	    6,709	  6,136</p>
<p>Imports	    9,598	  9,914</p>
<p>Balance	   -2,889	 -3,778</p>
</text>
